[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:Simbelmyne心贝铭]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:04.34]they disembarked in 45
[00:04.34]士兵们在45年的某日上岸
[00:07.90]and no one spoke and no one smiled
[00:07.90]码头上没有人说话也没有人微笑
[00:12.34]there were too many spaces in the line
[00:12.34]这归乡的行列中有太多空位
[00:20.88]gathered at the cenotaph
[00:20.88]在纪念碑前聚集的人们
[00:25.92]all agreed with the hand on heart
[00:25.92]都不约而同的将手放在胸前
[00:30.14]to sheath the sacrificial knives
[00:30.14]希望封存这饱含牺牲的刀刃
[00:36.70]but now
[00:36.70]可现在
[00:38.50]she stands upon southampton dock
[00:38.50]她站在南安普顿的码头上
[00:42.31]with her handkerchief
[00:42.31]带着她的手帕
[00:44.56]and her summer frock clings
[00:44.56]她的夏裙紧贴着
[00:47.08]to her wet body in the rain
[00:47.08]雨中被淋湿的身体
[00:55.48]in quiet desperation knuckles
[00:55.48]在平静的绝望中
[01:00.44]white upon the slippery reins
[01:00.44]握住湿滑缰绳的指节已经苍白
[01:04.22]she bravely waves the boys goodbye again
[01:04.22]她再次勇敢的向男孩们挥手告别
[01:25.91]and still the dark stain spreads between
[01:25.91]深色的斑点仍从
[01:30.71]their shoulder blades
[01:30.71]他们肩膀后插入的匕首处蔓延开来
[01:38.03]a mute reminder of the poppy fields and graves
[01:38.03]无声的暗示着罂粟田和坟墓
[01:48.43]and when the fight was over
[01:48.43]当战争结束后
[01:54.48]we spent what they had made
[01:54.48]我们用尽了他们牺牲换来的一切
[02:00.43]but in the bottom of our hearts
[02:00.43]在我们心底
[02:04.43]we felt the final cut
[02:04.43]已经感觉到了这终章的时刻
